('Q1','Complete system identity','README.md','full project quality management system','The opening names the complete system and its human–AI audience; lifecycle, roles and startup immediately follow. WHY, SKILL and the main guide independently explain the same identity.','README opening; WHY opening; SKILL opening/Manage the Whole Project; guide opening'),
('Q2','Epistemology is a foundation','WHY.md','Epistemology: the Evidence Foundation','The worked example is explicitly inside a managed project. The subsequent section distinguishes observations from goals, values and authority. The concepts support the method rather than exhaust it.','WHY Epistemology and Supporting Evidence Concepts; guide Epistemology Within the Method'),
('Q3','Whole lifecycle and management controls','docs/how-vp-works.md','Plan bounded stages','Eight lifecycle actions run from root mandate to retirement; planning identifies baselines, independent checks, budgets/tolerances and stop/reversal conditions. Exceptions require authority. No test alone accepts the project.','guide The Lifecycle and Its Gates; standard §§4/7/11.4; project playbook §§3/8'),
