('Q6','Concrete onboarding and explicit adoption','docs/how-vp-works.md','Start a Project or Use a Bounded Task','The reader is told to agree charter/mandate, copy linked templates, record root and first stage and adopt the standard for scope/time. Existing projects read six views before work; missing old history stays unknown. Bounded procedure use does not claim full conformance.','README Start Here; guide Start a Project or Use a Bounded Task; SKILL existing vp instruction; project playbook §§1/12 standard'),
